r to guarantee winning this trick. This prevents the Landlord from going out and gives us control of the final play.\n\nReason:\nThis is a must-win situation. With both the Landlord and teammate at 1 card each, I cannot afford to pass - doing so gives the Landlord a free win. Playing BlackJoker (the strongest single card) guarantees I win this trick, preventing the Landlord from playing out their final card. After winning, I\'ll have control and can manage the endgame with my remaining 5 cards against the Landlord\'s 1 card and teammate\'s 1 card.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["BlackJoker"]}'}
